  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GameUIManager
  mainMenuPanel: {fileID: 1937946381}
  settingsPanel: {fileID: 1574028187}
  fadePanel: {fileID: 40006240}
  buttonsPanel: {fileID: 1916479831}
  backgroundPanel: {fileID: 519074741}
  loadingText: {fileID: 601805806}
  fullText: 'June 16th, 1972


    Dear Diary, today is my first shift at the store.
    The streets are empty. I will probably read a book or find something to keep
    myself busy. It should be quiet. The town feels frozen, like it is holding its
    breath. Rumors about a serial killer have been spreading for weeks. I try to
    push the thoughts away, but they creep back in every time the wind rattles the
    windows. What if someone comes through that door? What if it is not a customer?
    I tell myself I can handle it. I tell myself it is just a story, just gossip.
    But still, I can not shake the feeling of being watched. Every creak, every distant
    noise makes my heart jump. If anything happens tonight, I do not know how I will
    make it until morning.


    Julian Frost'
  typingSpeed: 0.085
  waitAfterText: 2
  audioSource: {fileID: 1880828595}
  musicSource: {fileID: 1658746684}
  typeSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 75d2951302e3494489f453697f0c8336, type: 3}
